WEBVTT

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:51.030
<i>If she did...</i>

00:01:01.780 --> 00:01:06.080
STELLA GIRLS' ACADEMY

00:01:01.780 --> 00:01:06.080
HIGH SCHOOL DIVISION C  CLUB

00:01:06.660 --> 00:01:09.580
I decided this myself

00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:12.580
I decided that relying on chance

00:01:12.580 --> 00:01:18.090
is just so ridiculously fruitless

00:01:18.420 --> 00:01:23.050
I dwelled in my fantasies too much

00:01:23.050 --> 00:01:28.970
I'm going to leave my safety zone behind

00:01:29.010 --> 00:01:33.890
I try to keep my future in my crosshairs,

00:01:33.890 --> 00:01:38.190
and even though my aim is unsteady,

00:01:38.190 --> 00:01:41.530
I will hold my head high

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:45.200
I'll change my life,

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:48.240
and the gray rules that govern it

00:01:48.240 --> 00:01:54.080
even if I trip and stumble on the way

00:01:54.080 --> 00:02:00.000
Others are guiding me, but I will walk

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:06.720
My footprints in this world are so colorful

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:34.050
07:00 First Flag Drop

00:02:25.090 --> 00:02:33.900
07:00 First Flag Drop

00:02:34.190 --> 00:02:36.490
Let us begin!

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:41.090
Should the commander really be cold-blooded?

00:02:36.490 --> 00:02:41.730
This is where it starts for all teams in this 24-hour tournament.

00:02:41.730 --> 00:02:49.640
Witness the fervor the participating teams in real time using the cameras we deployed on the skirm site.

00:02:49.640 --> 00:02:55.100
There are only 47 flags for the 57 participating teams.

00:02:55.100 --> 00:02:59.820
The teams will have to obtain these flags in order to prolong their participation!

00:03:03.040 --> 00:03:05.030
Don't fall behind, Ren!

00:03:05.030 --> 00:03:06.370
Sorry.

00:03:06.890 --> 00:03:08.660
Come on...

00:03:16.320 --> 00:03:21.430
Only the teams who carry one of the flags dropped in a three hour window

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:25.720
to the main safety zone in the center of the site stay in the game.

00:03:26.280 --> 00:03:33.540
Since there are always fewer flags than surviving teams,

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:36.420
it's much like a game of musical chairs.

00:03:36.420 --> 00:03:38.730
This will be tough.

00:03:39.180 --> 00:03:42.470
I'm sure we will be fine.

00:03:42.470 --> 00:03:43.900
Yura came up with such good strategies.

00:03:43.900 --> 00:03:46.820
Yeah, and we practiced real hard.

00:03:46.820 --> 00:03:48.340
It'll work out.

00:03:48.340 --> 00:03:52.370
It was all pretty nice in theory, but applying it won't be so easy.

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:54.060
This is our first time here.

00:03:54.060 --> 00:03:55.460
We'll be fine.

00:03:56.050 --> 00:04:00.260
We will win if you stick to my plan.

00:04:00.790 --> 00:04:03.290
Even against Rin and her team.

00:04:03.290 --> 00:04:04.420
I think so too.

00:04:04.420 --> 00:04:06.060
G-Guess so.

00:04:06.060 --> 00:04:10.250
Let's go over our formation once more, then.

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:07.680
Today's Skirm

00:04:12.520 --> 00:04:14.020
Enemy contact!

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:16.860
They're just where Yura said they'd be.

00:04:20.800 --> 00:04:22.160
Ambush!

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:25.950
Stella, huh?

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:29.000
Running into them here might just be fate,

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:30.960
but we could do without it, honestly.

00:04:30.960 --> 00:04:32.360
Aira and I will draw them in.

00:04:32.360 --> 00:04:33.900
Yoichi and Miyagi, flank them.

00:04:33.900 --> 00:04:35.070
Hibiki, back us up.

00:04:36.120 --> 00:04:38.130
Their teamwork is pretty good.

00:04:39.400 --> 00:04:40.670
Attacking team!

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:45.880
While the defending team draws the enemy away,

00:04:45.880 --> 00:04:50.560
the attackers will swoop in from the side and grab the flag.

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:53.520
Hit! Damn it!

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:54.720
Damn.

00:04:57.560 --> 00:04:58.960
Hit!

00:04:58.960 --> 00:05:00.450
They've got our flag.

00:05:00.450 --> 00:05:01.540
We gotta get it back!

00:05:01.540 --> 00:05:02.320
Too hard.

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:04.270
We're pinned down here.

00:05:05.130 --> 00:05:07.610
While our point is carrying the flag,

00:05:07.610 --> 00:05:11.290
the defenders will shield her and then delay the remnants of the enemy.

00:05:16.370 --> 00:05:19.670
<i>That camo isn't The O.C.'s.</i>

00:05:22.470 --> 00:05:23.920
Is there a second team here?

00:05:24.360 --> 00:05:25.320
Ignore them!

00:05:25.320 --> 00:05:26.990
Keep our formation!

00:05:36.270 --> 00:05:37.250
Hit!

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:40.840
That is so lame.

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:43.290
What sort of plan is this?

00:05:43.290 --> 00:05:48.530
Well, we tried to put our acting talent to use.

00:05:48.530 --> 00:05:50.370
Only Aira is left now.

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:51.530
Help!

00:05:51.880 --> 00:05:53.550
They got the flag!

00:05:54.430 --> 00:05:56.080
Freeze.

00:05:57.990 --> 00:06:00.540
You're Aira, right?

00:06:02.360 --> 00:06:04.050
How did you know?

00:06:04.390 --> 00:06:09.420
I ordered Karira to go with Ren.

00:06:09.420 --> 00:06:12.220
Why would she be back alone?

00:06:12.220 --> 00:06:14.070
Ordered?

00:06:16.960 --> 00:06:20.060
Guess we've lost, then.

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:28.420
Strike!

00:06:28.420 --> 00:06:29.530
We're from Stella.

00:06:29.530 --> 00:06:33.130
One by one the teams are trickling into the safety zone with their flags.

00:06:33.130 --> 00:06:34.910
They've persevered!

00:06:37.400 --> 00:06:39.250
We're through round one.

00:06:40.850 --> 00:06:41.460
All right!

00:06:41.780 --> 00:06:46.080
I didn't think it would go so smoothly.

00:06:46.080 --> 00:06:48.420
Yeah, it was a good plan.

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:50.220
Oh, no! Ren!

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:53.060
I just bumped into something.

00:06:54.030 --> 00:06:55.810
It doesn't hurt all that much.

00:06:57.620 --> 00:06:58.810
Ren...

00:06:58.810 --> 00:07:01.040
Please stay alert, everyone!

00:07:01.040 --> 00:07:02.820
The tournament just started!

00:07:02.820 --> 00:07:10.370
Team Blood 13 is deemed to have had a zombie player, and is disqualified.

00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:16.480
Continuing to play in spite of being hit is against the rules.

00:07:16.480 --> 00:07:23.260
Every single instance will be punished with the entire team's disqualification.

00:07:23.260 --> 00:07:25.840
Please observe the rules.

00:07:26.290 --> 00:07:30.010
Guess this kind of thing won't die out.

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:32.660
They must want to win really badly.

00:07:32.660 --> 00:07:34.590
This is next to the worst thing to do, yes,

00:07:34.590 --> 00:07:36.850
but we're all desperate.

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:39.850
Let's focus on Rin's team.

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:44.680
Let's win this.

00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:45.270
10:00 Second Flag Drop

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:10.210
Breaking news! Today's big surprise, Stella Girls' Academy's C3 Club are all students!

00:08:11.260 --> 00:08:12.760
Holy crap!

00:08:13.450 --> 00:08:15.260
I'm on TV!

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:18.720
I wonder if they'll let me have a copy.

00:08:18.720 --> 00:08:21.830
Hachiyo, you're out of position here.

00:08:21.830 --> 00:08:24.140
You're falling behind, Hono.

00:08:24.140 --> 00:08:28.150
And Ren, you're getting slower and slower.

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:30.060
That's normal!

00:08:30.060 --> 00:08:33.070
She's carrying all our water and our food!

00:08:33.070 --> 00:08:35.020
She's got the heaviest back of us all!

00:08:35.020 --> 00:08:35.910
Also—

00:08:38.170 --> 00:08:39.410
Ren...

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:41.800
We talked about this!

00:08:41.800 --> 00:08:47.790
If we want a single person to back up point, then we need the firepower of the M60.

00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:50.170
I can do it.

00:08:53.730 --> 00:08:56.680
Look, the live coverage is showing Rin.

00:08:56.680 --> 00:09:03.920
Haruna Rin leads the team from Meisei Girls' Academy, hardened by numerous successful battles.

00:09:03.920 --> 00:09:08.270
I'm sure everyone is looking forward to a showdown between the two schoolgirl teams.

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:12.190
We have to win against Rin.

00:09:12.470 --> 00:09:15.450
I want to win too,

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:19.580
but this just isn't fun.

00:09:25.680 --> 00:09:27.410
It will be dark soon.

00:09:27.410 --> 00:09:29.470
Let's start preparing for night engagements.

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:40.600
19:00 Fifth Flag Drop

00:09:40.910 --> 00:09:43.910
We enter the second half of the tournament!

00:09:43.910 --> 00:09:47.450
LEDs have been attached to the flags.

00:09:45.310 --> 00:09:48.600
22:00 Sixth Flag Drop

00:09:47.450 --> 00:09:51.210
The remaining teams with have to fight with the night-time equipment they brought.

00:09:48.600 --> 00:09:51.820
4 Teams Remaining

00:09:51.210 --> 00:09:54.690
Teams will also have to fight against the drowsiness now.

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:57.950
This is harsh time for all.

00:09:58.860 --> 00:10:02.790
2 Teams Remaining

00:09:58.860 --> 00:10:02.790
01:00 Seventh Flag Drop

00:09:58.860 --> 00:10:02.790
2 Teams Remaining

00:10:01.870 --> 00:10:04.830
Before Last Flag Drop

00:10:05.880 --> 00:10:07.890
Please hang in there just a bit longer.

00:10:07.890 --> 00:10:09.880
The last flag will be dropped soon.

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:12.340
What's the situation look like?

00:10:12.340 --> 00:10:14.140
Two teams are left.

00:10:14.140 --> 00:10:16.570
Ours and Rin's.

00:10:16.570 --> 00:10:18.670
The moment of truth.

00:10:20.850 --> 00:10:22.450
Hey there, Stella girls.

00:10:22.450 --> 00:10:25.130
Looks like you got to the last stage.

00:10:25.130 --> 00:10:26.850
Oh, it's you guys!

00:10:27.370 --> 00:10:29.200
Why're you guys still up?

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:33.770
We want to find out who wins now that we're here.

00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:36.200
Hey there!

00:10:36.200 --> 00:10:39.080
Sorry we're not around there anymore.

00:10:39.080 --> 00:10:40.240
Aoi!

00:10:40.540 --> 00:10:45.740
We made it until nighttime, but ran into Meisei.

00:10:46.300 --> 00:10:47.990
Rin...

00:10:47.990 --> 00:10:50.630
We practiced a lot since the last time we met,

00:10:50.630 --> 00:10:53.250
and we used all our special moves too, but it was too hard.

00:11:00.290 --> 00:11:02.670
They steamrolled us.

00:11:02.670 --> 00:11:04.220
And not just the Aoi Family.

00:11:05.080 --> 00:11:07.520
Even the favorites for the title, the foreign marines, lost.

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:10.240
They said Rin and her girls annihilated them.

00:11:10.930 --> 00:11:12.800
The foreign marines...

00:11:12.800 --> 00:11:15.440
Annihilated...

00:11:16.130 --> 00:11:20.200
Their strength lies in how fast they move.

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:24.200
They rarely needed more than twenty minutes to get the flag to the safety zone.

00:11:24.480 --> 00:11:28.700
Other teams try to hold onto multiple flags occasionally to eliminate competitors,

00:11:29.020 --> 00:11:31.080
but they don't waste time on that.

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:36.750
Staying on the field too long increases the risks of getting hit and wears you out.

00:11:37.210 --> 00:11:43.650
Everyone they attacked was wiped out to the last man.

00:11:44.160 --> 00:11:49.370
They want to eliminate the risk of getting hit in the back, I guess.

00:11:49.370 --> 00:11:54.480
It also keeps them from being able to cheat with a zombie player if everybody's been hit anyway.

00:11:55.150 --> 00:11:58.980
Unsurprisingly, Rin and her team are the big favorite.

00:11:59.480 --> 00:12:04.420
Well, now that you won against us, at least win the tournament.

00:12:04.420 --> 00:12:06.030
Avenge us!

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:10.160
They're really good, huh?

00:12:10.160 --> 00:12:13.290
We're not who we used to be.

00:12:13.790 --> 00:12:15.860
I'm better than I used to be,

00:12:15.860 --> 00:12:18.230
and we all practiced so thoroughly.

00:12:18.230 --> 00:12:22.060
We would most likely win if we had Sono here with us.

00:12:22.060 --> 00:12:24.760
Is that why Rin fired at her?

00:12:25.570 --> 00:12:28.260
Do you think she'd go that far to win?

00:12:36.590 --> 00:12:38.380
<i>She's like me.</i>

00:12:38.380 --> 00:12:42.280
<i>No, she's not. She's not.</i>

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:44.520
<i>I'm not like her.</i>

00:12:44.520 --> 00:12:45.550
<i>But...</i>

00:12:57.440 --> 00:12:58.770
Hold on.

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:06.940
What do you want?

00:13:08.400 --> 00:13:09.550
Um...

00:13:10.340 --> 00:13:14.890
I want to ask you something, Rin.

00:13:15.200 --> 00:13:16.640
What is it?

00:13:17.280 --> 00:13:20.360
Um...

00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:23.810
We don't have much time.

00:13:23.810 --> 00:13:25.360
Please hurry.

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:30.990
Sonora taught me airsoft.

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:35.830
Airsoft is rather deep.

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:39.210
It made me think about life.

00:13:40.320 --> 00:13:42.010
Fancy words.

00:13:42.010 --> 00:13:43.770
Sounds like something Sonora would say.

00:13:45.120 --> 00:13:51.660
No matter how you sugarcoat it, airsoft mimicks war and bloodshed.

00:13:51.660 --> 00:13:54.390
If you lose in a real war, you lose for good.

00:13:54.390 --> 00:13:56.070
This is the same.

00:13:56.610 --> 00:14:01.310
If there is some deeper meaning to this, then I'd say it's that only victory has meaning.

00:14:04.880 --> 00:14:07.700
That's not what you wanted to ask.

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:11.700
You want to ask me whether I fired at Sonora, right?

00:14:13.900 --> 00:14:15.590
What if I did?

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:19.810
I think I asked you the following before.

00:14:19.810 --> 00:14:22.390
Why do you fight?

00:14:23.500 --> 00:14:28.200
Did you only sign up for this tournament to get revenge for Sonora?

00:14:28.720 --> 00:14:30.390
I...

00:14:31.210 --> 00:14:34.650
I'm sure Sonora would tell you to forget about that.

00:14:34.650 --> 00:14:38.810
She'd tell you that having fun is what counts.

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:45.880
You'll never win against me if this was some sort of epiphany for you.

00:14:55.950 --> 00:14:58.200
Where'd Yura go?

00:14:58.860 --> 00:15:01.960
The last flag's gonna get dropped soon.

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:04.710
She said she'd be right back.

00:15:06.200 --> 00:15:09.140
Nobody spends this long on the toilet.

00:15:09.140 --> 00:15:11.240
I'll be damned if this isn't selfish.

00:15:11.240 --> 00:15:13.720
She ordered us around the entire time.

00:15:14.340 --> 00:15:17.430
This is so hypocritical.

00:15:17.870 --> 00:15:19.360
Damn her.

00:15:19.360 --> 00:15:21.390
Don't say that!

00:15:21.960 --> 00:15:24.650
We'll win soon!

00:15:25.470 --> 00:15:27.940
Ren, but...

00:15:28.210 --> 00:15:30.400
I'm sure that's what Yura is thinking of too.

00:15:30.780 --> 00:15:32.460
That's why she's working so hard.

00:15:32.460 --> 00:15:34.370
I want to win this with you too!

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:39.390
I want to tell Sono that we won!

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:45.350
I guess...

00:15:45.350 --> 00:15:47.000
We've come so far!

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:49.560
We're so close!

00:15:49.560 --> 00:15:52.080
So close, huh?

00:15:55.440 --> 00:15:56.740
The time has come!

00:15:56.740 --> 00:15:58.690
The final battle has come!

00:15:58.690 --> 00:16:01.210
Left are only Meisei Girls' Academy and Steally Girls' Academy.

00:16:01.210 --> 00:16:05.280
How unusual that we should see two all-girl highschool teams here!

00:16:05.280 --> 00:16:09.190
Now then, who will claim the victory?

00:16:11.900 --> 00:16:13.970
Where the hell'd you go?

00:16:13.970 --> 00:16:15.280
Let's talk later.

00:16:15.720 --> 00:16:17.160
The battle is about to begin.

00:16:17.160 --> 00:16:18.430
Sorry.

00:16:21.470 --> 00:16:24.040
Let's win this.

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:25.880
Definitely.

00:16:27.640 --> 00:16:29.610
<i>I won't lose this.</i>

00:16:31.310 --> 00:16:32.760
<i>I won't lose to her!</i>

00:16:35.180 --> 00:16:36.680
The flag is dropped!

00:16:48.970 --> 00:16:52.190
<i>I'm sure Rin has something in store for us.</i>

00:16:58.080 --> 00:17:00.080
An ambush?

00:17:10.930 --> 00:17:12.040
Damn.

00:17:12.040 --> 00:17:13.980
They know our positions.

00:17:13.980 --> 00:17:15.260
I've been spotted too.

00:17:19.310 --> 00:17:20.420
Pull back.

00:17:20.420 --> 00:17:21.890
Take formation W.

00:17:24.720 --> 00:17:26.380
<i>As anticipated.</i>

00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:28.550
<i>It's just Stella, I guess.</i>

00:17:37.110 --> 00:17:39.280
Hit!

00:17:39.280 --> 00:17:40.870
Take formation A!

00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:43.080
Hono comes with me!

00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:47.620
The enemy has surrounded us on three sides.

00:17:48.160 --> 00:17:51.090
Why are they showing no interest in the flag?

00:17:51.090 --> 00:17:53.080
They don't need it.

00:17:53.080 --> 00:17:57.230
They will annihilate us and ignore the flag.

00:17:57.230 --> 00:17:58.970
That's Rin's way of doing it.

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:01.720
Damn that broad.

00:18:02.320 --> 00:18:04.970
Since we know what they're planning, we have a chance!

00:18:39.160 --> 00:18:41.020
Two are inside!

00:18:41.020 --> 00:18:43.350
Wait! Something is wrong.

00:18:45.960 --> 00:18:47.050
Rin!

00:18:55.560 --> 00:18:59.420
Too bad you're out of position and don't have numbers anymore.

00:18:59.420 --> 00:19:02.820
This is such a naive plan.

00:19:37.740 --> 00:19:39.990
I win.

00:19:40.330 --> 00:19:41.520
Hit.

00:19:42.530 --> 00:19:44.570
Damn it!

00:19:47.490 --> 00:19:49.000
<i>Kari.</i>

00:19:53.770 --> 00:19:55.630
Don't go in alone, Yura!

00:19:56.310 --> 00:19:58.570
Go, Hono.

00:19:58.570 --> 00:20:00.510
I'll hold this position alone.

00:20:01.300 --> 00:20:02.260
Okay.

00:20:07.730 --> 00:20:10.200
I should give you my praise for coming this far.

00:20:10.200 --> 00:20:12.640
You're a much better leader than Sonora.

00:20:12.640 --> 00:20:16.900
You will pay!

00:20:27.140 --> 00:20:28.200
A stoppage?

00:20:29.710 --> 00:20:31.000
Yura!

00:21:00.330 --> 00:21:01.320
Hit.

00:21:06.420 --> 00:21:08.830
You and I are the same.

00:21:09.590 --> 00:21:11.710
We'd do anything to win.

00:21:35.370 --> 00:21:37.970
All members of Meisei's team have been hit!

00:21:37.970 --> 00:21:43.360
The winner of this long battle is Stella Girls' Academy's C3 Club!!

00:21:39.650 --> 00:21:43.360
Stella Girls' Academy
C³ Club

00:21:52.360 --> 00:21:53.390
Yura!

00:21:53.390 --> 00:21:55.200
Meisei was annihilated!

00:21:56.590 --> 00:21:59.250
We won!

00:22:04.330 --> 00:22:05.590
<i>I...</i>

00:22:08.530 --> 00:22:09.760
<i>won...</i>

00:22:10.140 --> 00:22:11.060
Command!

00:22:11.720 --> 00:22:12.930
Control!

00:22:13.390 --> 00:22:15.190
Communication!

00:22:15.190 --> 00:22:16.230
The C3 Club!

00:22:16.230 --> 00:22:16.850
Yay!

00:22:16.850 --> 00:22:20.070
Survival doesn't make the gunshots stop

00:22:20.070 --> 00:22:23.400
Carrying the flag I hear gunfire

00:22:23.400 --> 00:22:28.530
Smile, 'cause isn't this fun?

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:30.620
Yay!

00:22:31.990 --> 00:22:36.750
I blush when I make eye contact with my comrade,

00:22:36.750 --> 00:22:38.580
but that's fine

00:22:38.580 --> 00:22:41.710
Let's trust each other and laugh

00:22:41.710 --> 00:22:42.710
Ready?

00:22:43.260 --> 00:22:45.220
3, 2, 1, go! Go!

00:22:45.220 --> 00:22:48.260
Take your comrade and get the flag!

00:22:48.260 --> 00:22:51.970
Can't you feel your heart thump when you advance?

00:22:51.970 --> 00:22:55.060
Let's hit them and laugh

00:22:55.060 --> 00:22:55.980
All right?

00:22:56.640 --> 00:22:58.600
3, 2, 1, go! Go!

00:22:58.600 --> 00:23:01.940
It can be hard, it can be vexing,

00:23:01.940 --> 00:23:04.780
but when you overcome that

00:23:05.070 --> 00:23:11.870
you'll smile like you never did before

00:23:11.870 --> 00:23:13.580
Everyone, take up positions!

00:23:13.580 --> 00:23:14.120
Okay!

00:23:15.080 --> 00:23:18.580
Survival doesn't make the gunshots stop

00:23:18.580 --> 00:23:21.710
Carrying the flag I hear gunfire

00:23:21.710 --> 00:23:25.800
Enjoy your youth, even if your tears are stolen

00:23:28.340 --> 00:23:31.850
Telepathy, a step forward

00:23:31.850 --> 00:23:34.890
Don't look down, look ahead

00:23:34.890 --> 00:23:35.770
Sorry it took me so long to be enthusiastic about it!

00:23:39.770 --> 00:24:09.630
Preview

00:23:40.290 --> 00:23:43.210
Something noteworthy happen while I was in the hospital?

00:23:43.210 --> 00:23:46.170
I borrowed your camo clothes and got them dirty.

00:23:46.170 --> 00:23:47.130
Don't worry!

00:23:47.130 --> 00:23:49.550
It only makes them more realistic anyway.

00:23:49.550 --> 00:23:51.480
I ate your instant noodles.

00:23:51.480 --> 00:23:53.440
What is this? Only guilty confessions?

00:23:53.440 --> 00:23:54.780
I got something nice to tell!

00:23:54.780 --> 00:23:55.820
What is it? Let's hear.

00:23:55.820 --> 00:23:59.560
Your locker had "Danger!" written on it, so I tossed it out!

00:23:59.560 --> 00:24:01.000
What?!

00:24:01.000 --> 00:24:01.640
Next episode.

00:24:01.000 --> 00:24:09.630
And thus the feast ends.

00:24:01.640 --> 00:24:03.270
And thus the feast ends.

00:24:03.270 --> 00:24:05.080
Come on, tell me I did well.

00:24:05.080 --> 00:24:08.000
All my precious Playboy magazines...
